# Thesis documents.
#
# Excluded deliberately: the thesis carries the author's full name and student
# index number, and publishing an unsubmitted dissertation can trip plagiarism
# checks or simply be copied. This repository is the software; the thesis is
# personal academic work and is kept out of it.
#
# To include them anyway (fine on a private repository), delete these two
# lines and run:  git add -f *.docx
*.docx
